        <div><span>AUG–OCT</span>
          <strong>Capture demand while managing installation slots</strong></div>
        <div><span>NOV–DEC</span>
          <strong>Fulfill promises, document work and plan renewals</strong></div>
      </div>
      <p>This is an illustrative calendar, not a universal
      peak-season forecast. Adapt it to your local market.</p>
